  partName: Clip (4)
  description: The Clip (4) is a tiny, complex fastener located at the top-center-front
    of the engine, designed to secure various engine components such as hoses, wires,
    and cables. Made of Material.001, this clip provides a reliable and durable hold,
    protecting the engine's components from damage and wear. Interestingly, its complex
    shape allows it to accommodate multiple components, making it a versatile and
    essential part of the engine's assembly.
